        <UserObject label="Communication and power check" tooltip="The PC commands the gripper at the needed rate; supply, cable and mass are acceptable on a tethered handheld. Possible only after delivery.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Project plan" detail="The PC commands the gripper at the needed rate; supply, cable and mass are acceptable on a tethered handheld. Possible only after delivery." source="Project plan" status="open" id="n19">
