        <UserObject label="Cable clip, UR10e supply" tooltip="The cable clip depends on where the cables leave the gripper. The UR10e tool connector supplies 24 V at 2 A, below the gripper&#x27;s 3.5 A peak, so the robot-side gripper very likely needs an external supply.&#xa;&#xa;Source: UR10e datasheet; Unitree product page" detail="The cable clip depends on where the cables leave the gripper. The UR10e tool connector supplies 24 V at 2 A, below the gripper&#x27;s 3.5 A peak, so the robot-side gripper very likely needs an external supply." source="UR10e datasheet; Unitree product page" status="open" link="https://www.universal-robots.com/manuals/latest/en/datasheets/ur10e/" id="n21">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2fb8a3;fontColor=#1f2a37;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeWidth=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
