        <UserObject label="Recommendation" tooltip="Real Dex1-1 as the main line; printed copy kept at its current design state as the documented fallback. For discussion.&#xa;&#xa;Source: Accompanying brief" detail="Real Dex1-1 as the main line; printed copy kept at its current design state as the documented fallback. For discussion." source="Accompanying brief" status="" id="n22">
