        <UserObject label="Precedent: UMI, RDT2, TacUMI" tooltip="UMI (Chi et al., 2024) and RDT2 (Liu et al., 2026) use a printed copy of the robot gripper; UMI and UMI-3D (Wang, 2026) use a printed linkage; TacUMI (Cheng et al., 2026) uses a continuous lock instead of a ratchet.&#xa;&#xa;Source: arXiv:2402.10329; arXiv:2602.03310; arXiv:2604.14089; arXiv:2601.14550" detail="UMI (Chi et al., 2024) and RDT2 (Liu et al., 2026) use a printed copy of the robot gripper; UMI and UMI-3D (Wang, 2026) use a printed linkage; TacUMI (Cheng et al., 2026) uses a continuous lock instead of a ratchet." source="arXiv:2402.10329; arXiv:2602.03310; arXiv:2604.14089; arXiv:2601.14550" status="" link="https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.10329" id="n30">
